    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="17e13470-9458-50f3-80a0-01a83d882457" activityNameId="f938c3b5-bc5e-5ac6-8568-30f596a0444d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Milking</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Milking
The module includes the use of energy and auxiliary materials for the operation of lighting, milking machine and cleaning of the milking machine, milking parlour and milk room. The functional unit is 1 kg milk.;
UUID: 6daab73d-486c-3ae5-9cb9-d577b7f91ade
The inventory takes into account the energy and auxiliary materials like water, lubricating oil and cleaning agents. Also included is the use of the infrastructure. Not taken into account were the direct emission of the animal husbandry, fodder production and produced waste water.
Location: The inventory applies for Swiss agricultural buildings only, because of the solid method of construction.
Technology: The use of energy and auxiliary materials are calculated for the conditions defined in the infrastructure-module with literature data and experts knowledge.
Time period: Period indicated in the reference. 
Production volume: Existing milking parlour in CH in 1996: 2434 units.
Sampling: In the use of energy and auxiliary materials are big differences between the farms. The inventory is based on mean values from CH and WEU. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6daab73d-486c-3ae5-9cb9-d577b7f91ade.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
